  <h1>The Disease That Killed 300 Million: How Humanity Wiped It Out</h1>
  <p class="dek">A disease that killed 300 million people in one century was declared dead in 1980. It became the first and only human disease ever eradicated. The man who led the campaign had a forked needle and a smarter strategy.</p>
